NOTICE OF MODIFICATION (Apache License 2.0, section 4(b))
---------------------------------------------------------
privden does NOT ship stock Tuwunel. The tuwunel.exe distributed with privden is
built from Tuwunel v2.0.0 with privden's patches applied. The Tuwunel project is
not responsible for, and did not produce, this modified build.

The patches set build flags for privden's Windows build machine, box one stream
in the integrity checks so that the server links on macOS, and add an
administrator command that clears an account's one-time keys, which privden runs
after a server is restored from a backup. They do not alter the Matrix protocol
behaviour, the federation logic, or the storage format.

The following files are changed or added relative to upstream v2.0.0:

    .cargo/config.toml
    docs/backups.md
    src/admin/user/clear_one_time_keys.rs
    src/admin/user/mod.rs
    src/service/integrity/redactions.rs
    src/service/users/keys.rs
    src/service/users/tests.rs

Every modification is kept as a reviewable unified diff under patches/ in the
privden source tree; patches/README.md documents each one and the file it
targets. No upstream file is modified by any other means.

