EFF Short Wordlist #1
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Used by: service-wrapper/assets/passphrase-wordlist.txt (passphrase generator).

The passphrase wordlist is the EFF Short Wordlist #1, published by the
Electronic Frontier Foundation:

    https://www.eff.org/files/2016/09/08/eff_short_wordlist_1.txt
    https://www.eff.org/dice

Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 United States license
(CC BY 3.0 US): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/us/

Changes made to the original work (permitted under CC BY 3.0 with this notice):
  - The leading dice-roll column and tab separator were removed, leaving one
    bare word per line.
  - The single hyphenated entry "yo-yo" was omitted because the hyphen is the
    passphrase separator (1296 -> 1295 words).
No words were added or otherwise altered.

